<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5627" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμυστ-ις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιος</span> and
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιδος</span> (<i><span class="en">
			Alc.
			<u>Supp.</u>
			4.20
		</span></i>), ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>long draught,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμυστιν προπιεῖν, πίνειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anacr.
					63
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑλκύσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Cyc.</u>
					417
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χανδὸν ἄμυστιν οἰνοποτεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Aet.</u>
					1.1.11
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμυστιν ὥσπερ κύλικα πίνει τὸν βίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epich.
					34
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>deep drinking, tippling,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				438
			</span></i>, cf. Sch. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>large cup,</i> used by Thracians, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμυστιν ἐκλάπτειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					1229
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Amips.
				22
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				11.783d
			</span></i>.</div>
